Building POS

Native Linux (Ubuntu 22.04 / 24.04 / 26.04)
-------------------------------------------
See doc/build-unix.txt for CLI (posd) and GUI (pos-qt) instructions.

Windows cross-compile from Ubuntu 22.04
---------------------------------------
See doc/build-windows.txt, or run:

  ./compile-windows.sh

See doc/readme-qt.rst for additional Qt options.
See doc/build-*.txt for platform-specific notes on building posd,
the intended-for-services, no-graphical-interface, reference
implementation of POS.
